# sabotage=PassesDropCalls: behind the pass a call of an unknown function is gone. The pass answers for the accesses that it resolves, and for nothing else: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass ResolveAccesses
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-in-a-loop-left-alone.ir
